      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen Peptides: What They Are and How They Actually Work</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">
        Whole collagen is far too large to be absorbed, which is the single fact most supplement
        marketing skips over. This is the science pillar: what hydrolysis does, which fragments
        survive digestion, and why the useful ones behave like instructions rather than raw material.
      </p>

